# WebMCP origin-trial token for stable Chrome/Edge visitors (149–156 trial).
# The shell's head() emits it as <meta http-equiv="origin-trial">; without it
# document.modelContext never exists outside agent-embedded browsers like the
# ChatGPT desktop app, and the page tools silently stay off.
# Register the deployed origin at https://developer.chrome.com/origintrials,
# paste the token here as .env, then rebuild and redeploy — the value is baked
# into the build, not read at runtime. Origin-trial tokens are public by design.
PRACHT_PUBLIC_WEBMCP_OT_TOKEN=
